&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HiveWatch is a tech-forward, inclusive organization fostering the evolution of the physical security industry. We are a diverse team of forward thinkers who empower each other to find creative and collaborative solutions in an industry ripe for modernization. We are passionate about the problems we’re solving for our customers and equally passionate about the company we’re building.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HiveWatch is here to help security teams pivot from chasing threats to preventing them. We protect organizations, people, and property through the intelligent orchestration of physical security programs. With better communication, more insights, and less “noise”, we are modernizing what it means for businesses and their employees to truly feel safe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Director of Engineering, you will be managing a high-performing engineering org consisting of 3-4 squads of engineers covering our product value streams from our HQ in El Segundo, CA. We have team members stretching from El Segundo to LATAM to central Europe. This role will report directly to our VP, Engineering. You will mentor, lead, and grow our team of software and infra engineers while operating effectively in a Series B environment—comfortable with ambiguity, lean process, and rolling up your sleeves into code, design reviews, or incident response when the situation calls for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of Engineering you will also:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive hiring strategy and close top engineering talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivate and communicate across multiple levels of their department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have successful peer partnerships with other department leaders in Engineering, and cross-functionally (product, sales, marketing, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product leadership to translate roadmap into executable engineering plans, including running prioritization and trade-off conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development, measurement, and management of key metrics for team performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert hiring manager skills and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A well developed people management philosophy for managers and engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing managers and engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise customers (Fortune 500 or regulated industries) with high-touch deployments and uptime expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading distributed teams across multiple time zones (e.g., US plus Europe or LATAM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has directly owned performance management cycles, including coaching, leveling, and exiting underperformers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: experience scaling an engineering org through Series B to C growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile/kanban project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to understand, communicate and improve the quality of multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Humble, servant leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, 5+ years of leadership experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years production operations experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging skills across distributed systems and microservices architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL INFO&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary range for this position: $203,000 to $255,000 per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to participate in HiveWatch Equity Incentive Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Final offer will be at the company&#39;s sole discretion and determined by multiple factors, including years and depth of relevant experience and expertise, location, and other business considerations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS &amp;amp; CULTURE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HiveWatch, we’re passionate about taking care of our people — and it shows in the benefits we offer. Our team enjoys:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health coverage:&amp;nbsp; medical, dental, vision, and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cutting-edge work in an emerging field with huge growth potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation packages designed to reward top talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A modern, newly renovated HQ right on Main Street in El Segundo, CA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with a 4% company match to help you invest in your future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off so you can recharge when you need it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional benefits include ClassPass credits and a discount on pet insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A family-friendly, compassionate culture that values balance and belonging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage you to challenge the status quo, share your perspective, and leave fear at the (access-controlled) door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our EEO Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HiveWatch is an equal opportunity employer and we are committed to cultivating a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. We execute our hiring practices so that they are merit-based and we do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, marital status, age, disability, medical condition, genetic information, national origin, ancestry, military or veteran status, or other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;

01a-wheelhouse:greenhouse:4704758005.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Technical Product Manager who sits at the intersection of platform, partnerships, and AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;In the near term, you&#39;ll help shape and guide our API, integrations, and developer platform roadmap. Longer term, you&#39;ll help define how Wheelhouse intelligence is accessed and utilized across an increasingly connected ecosystem of applications, workflows, and emerging AI technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;We&#39;re not trying to use AI to replace revenue managers. We&#39;re building tools that make great operators dramatically more effective.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;This is not a roadmap maintenance role. It&#39;s a builder role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll help shape how Wheelhouse connects with the world—through APIs, integrations, MCP, developer tooling, and intelligent systems that help operators make faster, smarter revenue decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work on questions like:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;What should developers and AI systems be able to build on top of Wheelhouse?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;How should Wheelhouse expose its capabilities through Model Context Protocol? What tools do we publish, and how do partners and intelligent systems interact with them?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Which partner requests should become &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-164454118921815622428163 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;scaled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt; platform capabilities?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;How do we make Wheelhouse &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3rz72zxz76zz122zk67689xe08uz80zz77zblbul0z82zz86zz82z5z76z&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;ntelligence available wherever revenue decisions are being made?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;What platform investments create the most leverage for customers, partners, and the broader ecosystem?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;How We Think About Product Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;At Wheelhouse, Product Managers aren&#39;t roadmap gatekeepers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;We&#39;re a small team of highly engaged builders, and some of our best ideas come from engineers, customer-facing teams, partners, leadership, and customers themselves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Your role isn&#39;t to dictate priorities from a spreadsheet. It&#39;s to create clarity where there is ambiguity, facilitate productive conversations, identify the highest-leverage opportunities, and help great ideas become great products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for bringing together diverse perspectives, asking the right questions, making tradeoffs visible, and helping the organization move forward with confidence and alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re energized by collaboration, ownership of outcomes, and building alongside a smart, best-in-class team, you&#39;ll thrive here.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ace-all-bold-hthree&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Ecosystem Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Help shape the roadmap for APIs, MCPs, integrations, webhooks, and developer tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering, leadership, partnerships, and customer-facing teams to identify the highest-impact platform investments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Look for opportunities to transform one-off requests into reusable capabilities that benefit the broader ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Champion developer experience through thoughtful API design, documentation, onboarding, and platform reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ace-all-bold-hthree&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Emerging Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Evaluate how AI can create meaningful value for operators, partners, and developers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Help define how Wheelhouse intelligence can be accessed through emerging technologies, standards, and workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering to identify practical applications of AI that improve customer outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ace-all-bold-hthree&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership &amp;amp; Platform Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Client Success, Support, and external partners to identify integration opportunities, friction points, and evolving customer needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Stay current on partner API capabilities, roadmap changes, and emerging technologies that could create value for Wheelhouse customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Translate customer, partner, and internal feedback into scalable API, integration, and ecosystem investments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Help ensure Wheelhouse remains a trusted and easy-to-integrate partner across the hospitality technology landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ace-all-bold-hthree&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Lead discovery, requirements gathering, and product definition across initiatives and collaborate across teams to validate final scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Create clear, concise specifications that communicate the problem to be solved, proposed solution, key requirements, and tradeoffs—using workflows, prototypes, and mockups where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Optimize for clarity, alignment, and execution rather than lengthy documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Identify risks, edge cases, and dependencies early.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Measure adoption, customer impact, and business outcomes to inform future investments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;We&#39;re Looking For Someone Who&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Has 5+ years of product management experience, ideally in APIs, integrations, developer tooling, technical SaaS products, or ecosystem-focused products and has already launched some AI products/features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Can comfortably discuss APIs, webhooks, authentication, integrations, data models, and modern software architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Is deeply curious about AI,MCPs and emerging technologies, and actively incorporates new tools and capabilities into their daily work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Keeps pace with the rapidly evolving AI landscape and enjoys exploring how new technologies can create meaningful customer value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Thinks critically about AI—able to distinguish durable opportunities from hype and identify practical applications that improve outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Is excited by platforms, ecosystems, and enabling others to build on top of great products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Has strong product judgment and knows when to solve a specific problem versus build a reusable capability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4ecz122z4iz74z2z79zsaz74zz81zcz75zfnz90zjz80zz80zcoz81zy1z70zz87zsa&quot;&gt;Communicates effectively with engineers, customers, partners, and executives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
