&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3rz72zxz76zz122zk67689xe08uz80zz77zblbul0z82zz86zz82z5z76z&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3rz72zxz76zz122zk67689xe08uz80zz77zblbul0z82zz86zz82z5z76z&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this position is between $&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz85zrz90z5z83zapz73ziz82zpz87zlz70z0qxz72zez89zz88zpz87zz66zjkz68zoz75zz75z&quot;&gt;136,000 - $152,000&lt;/span&gt; depending on experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
