&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 55, 42);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Now Available: Sign-On Bonus Up to $5,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
