&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 55, 42);&quot;&gt;If you want to be appreciated, come to BAYADA:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is looking for a Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) who has a passion for Pediatric or Adult care to join our Passaic County team. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
